{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 936,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff67dc39f3ec750e6010d349",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛里有赛马娘持有「同理心」技能\\n则极大提升速度,并使全员持有的「同理心」\\n无视条件直接发动＜中距离・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7854fd4b83c1eee47d78e5eaadff985a96662e0680b4ab8f7e4501ecfc6d4645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4dd864d5a37bb34c94faa6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余200m的地点自身位于第二名\\n与中间队伍之间的位置时,速度提升\\n且附近赛马娘数量达3人以上时再稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a695af0c85a30ff38f151b39832ca24fc96cd980d48d557299e68cd4f6c5575",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25455c65da00aa120fb1d10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道,如果被先头甩开的话\\n距离越远越能继续努力\\n速度也会一点点提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "302d881cb915a0bf2430d28495d9b270131ec8d1bbccd4a72e64a205f79f577b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ccf2cf6a21ea6b18c64de6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余200m处位于前方时速度少量提升\\n若在短距离比赛的终盘进行过赶超\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f44ba2e4883de60f3c5cf78f2c98834ee31615a39698e6e941f5a1d377e1f95",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fcde5839974694690ba34c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道处于中间集团时\\n若附近有其他赛马娘，则在最终直线上\\n速度会提升，并且\\n状态绝佳时会小幅向前冲出",
      "source_fingerprint": "f140c6cdc0daab68892a239c670778ac67c58e0557456562822f3d49102e8838",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ba745d6431293223a0ac18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半于后方被紧追时\\n得幸运以护体\\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf6e2a022f443ea7db5923f6dd9de8684bba21557c854231af783f4fcdf108b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa3b704580df9e562676fe1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于后方时,根据\\n剩余耐力进行相应时间的长距离冲刺\\n使速度持续稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4fe012430f333ef8551c3db43bb4eb6787aea52bcad66748d845c7b4f96097",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de82df8ea06f3b76e1cf665b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线时若位于前方\\n则提升速度\\n并使前后各2名赛马娘稍微畏惧",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe913597bcae30267dc4bccbc7a9ce62767a323b72c1fa87750002c318839df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6767c5e6ef1d355ad1e643",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即将进入比赛终盘的下坡、处于队伍中央\\n且距离终点较远时\\n会尽情地享受比赛,提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be1abebab1fc55e98cd0573bb3fb7439390aaa67fa0dadf623d6f5291ab8d88",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e10feb75264e5a6353ce111",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后超过对手\\n并在最终直线处于中间集团时加快速度\\n若人气处于后列则能振奋起来持续提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f25936b1432a4bc1bcb8257eec3f2a08bb9c717149885719c7be05e39b627be2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0be08015c5735f65ddad4410",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于队伍中后方时\\n回复大量体力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9339f27b166c474fbd98a73dc9444a99341077686991ee0cbb1947052472dce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c56931eae4a346c6598cec41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于队伍中后方时\\n回复少量体力并提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "edb29c859742064733992ed3e89364210b8a8334fb34c83bb9f8074fed42bb71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110601121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d89c0e25181ddafd9390a31f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于队伍中间时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "203cdcd5d9c1dac2b4ff477abf76e2d4af272c8aa6b3c417260d88e91b76a095",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f47a7d77279ed9cc173a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "紧跟前方赛马娘时,速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5acb44550a4233243c8ac56410d51dc63ef6bea35a0f46f22fb7ad20ecdcc2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed93d9440b879cb065bac048",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期更早时间内位于中后方时\\n加速度少量提升,若发动技能时位于下坡\\n且有充足余力,则大幅向前突进\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c21554b3c129c2f1a2bdad1c0ecac322a25b79cc4edebe74fcc5e17fccb288",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12dcc3e3a248bbf893eda283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程前半,没有焦躁并处于最后方附近\\n等待机会时,在最终直线\\n会气势爆发,提高加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ed9d6cc593b4094882dacd943fdfa6e2f98a64fe113b793ce357bbafef79bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c16a08c43e043b97d835a37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛后半的弯道处位于队伍中间\\n则根据剩余体力在相应时间内提升少量速度\\n中距离比赛时额外略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2436c93bc5787ce83129e81e2207898908ec569525976bf7a78a9ee6613f7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b58d13c058c528117fe6026",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期试图超越\n或被接近时，短暂略微向前突进\n若是中距离比赛，之后在终盘迫近的\n某处若位于前方，则短暂提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7300236223effbf9b4fcdad1afd55d405d93e73fdc31f80028b93d927e686b4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d9cd9c20d08a46d2012a40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段以后的直线位于领头时\\n长时间内速度持续少量提升,如果\\n在中山竞马场发动了「爆领」技能\\n长时间内持续微量额外提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "21032f3106919cf7ac3a6718aabf57a540bccb005c06ab057fa82fe3ef94769b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863e9f86b4b608bcff78bbac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘位于前方竞争时\\n速度提升,若是英里比赛\\n则消耗体力使速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "25073c6b38015b06365734e7836bf628f5f13f5416d7075096b8e59851e08bef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1396b0d39e41f7f1b5251017",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于中间集团时\\n绽放璀璨光芒,提升速度\\n并回复少量持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cd8d2c00bac03f5d0402c699ae3a432564ec86edab7b615e7b27f45ea31d8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ff83bd14247f15eb6186f9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的弯道处位于前方\\n且距离终点尚远时,短时间内向前突进\\n并提升微量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1a190293f89152d671cf097b2abe3b00fc00c8708cb491b76c8bfaf8e967cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db23fc781711846ff71a11a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛中盘展开竞争\\n且在剩下650m处处于好位置\\n就会为了实现梦想持续提升加速力",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf1c416aff3e9d826df4e415bf6edc7e74e09f8b150afb37cde8c2ff2920a63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f7432957db9632fce61deb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段靠近中团时\\n速度会持续小幅度提升\\n在中距离比赛中,如果力量非常高\\n速度会较长时间持续小幅度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e6f40367083606372ce307bcb54d6e73fa956cc6a0d1b341a59a9c9151e59c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8085d03fd895513c3485ff2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘位于领头时大幅提升速度\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfffb733f2ba5c6762abb0cc114740bf7d5b1a58f516aff50f3217f898e74a4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578486cfd3d12855a0bdf8c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘若发动多项技能且位于领头时\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "944d664ecedac3f79b985e40bf4fe2003c29879beb0985c2e37a23987fa19ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d211f5f0eb864fda962867",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线在领头位置且后方1马身内有马娘时\\n速度极大提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71aafbd2aa8c7a8b3417c6f1e885a771234c8c82d9cf66b5fb5103742a57c87c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076ab6678b2663b9ce9ec23f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期大幅消耗耐力\\n令速度大幅提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则额外向前稍微突进＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "02260035e9c1421565e9cf991d8a8a3a684fc8da5d0b555f6c685ad345bb1408",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b85631ffa5de8b0fafc2ff90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的最终直线处于好位置\\n且身后的马娘接近时,消耗少量体力\\n速度上升,并稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8dece35a52c1b9d4e071dfca54ebef1551132a7a4111f3749cf39be3da92ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9288723126b2f33757558f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中段前后进行竞争\\n则在比赛后半段随机位置提升速度\\n如果发动技能时位于内侧跑道\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b50028f787361fc3640e5f4b4e0519ebda7a150e0ce58485d4e5396d020668bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ed570bdae9a8a9fc0a2c9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘位于队伍中间时稍微放慢速度\\n并回复大量体力,当耐力有\\n十二分充足时,之后在终盘\\n会长时间持续向前突击",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efaea96fc1e3bf9d98c4e29e3c4b3c2c1f0e1053e8b37110ba7f060101df2ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199a521ccd15d8897350595d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于中团时\n提升速度，若是长距离比赛且\n若中盘曾发生过竞争，则极大提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86fa7dd17055288c08e41bfe36f87a4149503fd5d719952a49091f034100524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49f7abd6da79e8bf4dd79ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时通过技能恢复耐久力\\n比赛中段附近以后处于有利位置时\\n速度会稍微提升,如果距离终点\\n还很远则会大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb6236b01a8fcc2c93e230a67402fd763a9d3743fcb81cb40a37dc477c2e964",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038b1ce37a97238c07b1f647",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余350m的位置位于前方时\\n短时间内向前突进,若是英里比赛\\n则额外稍微增加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f253d2970e105323e871f2dd3f4104d988ed5beac28813d5269a4b4a9f90bcea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ebd42e0fa97b418777a4ee5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时若位于前方则会在短时间内\\n大幅提升速度，之后在比赛中段\\n附近被紧追时会略微向前冲出\\n＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a0d0611241555e0cc3f48f9f6b642dd72348dcdad0b846ec20151dec6203e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0386aaa488d55289bfddcfd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道处\\n一段时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "df403ca50cd4375b84430db94a1f0f64e3a4dca10f5e1cd7d53e321f20f0e7a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e945f3a226c66834766ff1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道处或者中山竞马场的\\n终盘弯道处位于中后方时\\n加速度提升,之后在最终直线处\\n稍微提升速度＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0515438df6b278ee290a23e65b37b9f0a1e6cffb652155af170e55a1e68a20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f93ff889a731cc9edbaf8a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段若位于中间集团以后\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n若在英里比赛中一直保持在后方\\n则速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "af03b7f7a30ee5d0da06d66655b5a44e2563dd1a62ba44eb7ea07ce95310cb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:686a1998b01d5cb93a4ba999",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行到一半位于队伍中间时,在最终直线处\\n提升速度,如果是中山竞马场的中距离比赛\\n则变为极大提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e14a5b8b5714fabb0f81a624bf5b0e92b121a73f8ae4cc5512a6713fa7406d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de818267924cf68191cfd96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段处于后方时会稍微向前突进\\n在英里赛中如果一直保持在最后方附近\\n会大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb6b9a70eff4972796b052239a817b4ef8e74f6a62b1b490f5fde6880a8ff7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02461e3015d0956f8f43ddda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行一半左右若位于中间位置\\n则速度少量提升,如果是英里比赛\\n则进一步增加效果和持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2b6a7388fe9d6b1b6c527d75d581e3b92bf548c39324fc06a6555a2ff99841",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ceda686f9846e696f6a9800",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,发动技能时\\n若位于领头或距离领头2马身以内\\n则速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd9e7fe2683bf44365bb8e960db1168e848fc961245c96622cb23eca61c760e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22f218dbb3c0b08e68a8cf40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "短距离比赛的赛程近半若位于前方\\n则速度提升,若智力有十二分高超\\n则大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1572195c60f129ff2c625e5729bfed879a6af9c2e550a39ec77736879894ead",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110871"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f0d8dda81246c368fe8996",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期进行超越时\\n短时间内大幅向前突进\\n若是中距离比赛则短时间内\\n极大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c402da608abd028a42adc362f12032ff9264d6c4bd54148e20a8e18e0ac8b443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110881"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee361a82eae900e3a552b6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中程附近若位于中间位置\\n则长时间持续少量提升速度,并回复耐力\\n若比赛距离小于3000m,则不回复耐力\\n并长时间持续提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed7d1840b233ff3faaa00631aa4d366804aeda805af07e8904f1a4e35681a4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb802a43193e791b7906228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2a4f6102e0fb90ee006b68e123ec6f6b01620dd6e699dd7ad142b1fbc6491d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e07e1a0845683db4502405",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于前方时\n提升速度，此外若是东京赛场\n则额外稍微提升速度<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e568ffcdcdf45363900ad90a1ba18a31dc653cf6f13e4e907f7c993044705531",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4dd00b4a02a5e7d34e51ffb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时提高加速度\\n之后在剩余200m处速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd97dd302350ac61e202ff50244769dd832486ff2870abda45cbdb8e6dbe2a35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3636aaa97e359d8de676403f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心中怀抱继承下来的强烈心愿\\n在比赛后半段大幅向前突进\\n并小幅回复耐力＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f035f2f7e66192702491cb03676b57ac79e86f2f58afe9a17ecf17450a8ea66a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0171ccc4273e7821ab20320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下坡时加速度提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a225156365c89cc3e5b3fe5106baae12ec1a9334835314e3c6d65b13a1d071",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90d9b09539e51c0ef442c15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的第3弯道位于\\n中间位置时,速度少量提升\\n若是2000m的比赛且此时是上坡\\n提升技能效果与持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d9b80674c0e07708a91965603d41a4644b40dd82c6a7ead4f055cc28dd7724",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b087a35026f2c4bcad437953",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在队伍中游进行过竞争时\\n最终冲刺时速度提升,若是短距离比赛\\n且在技能发动时位于前三名\\n则额外稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "79be933f400bf0975b31c4eea98463949d75738e132873d6a16b9801c7d2b0d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321f23e81a91a2c72c410bea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在中间集团及以后发生切磋时\n速度提升，若是中距离比赛\n则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78d79dc11bab12c352b2048e8e18af56d3b5c68ebc9b0ac9a5f2d48b88d3be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8325e15a779885f1af9898e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段位于前方时\\n如果距离终点较远则会向前冲刺＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25021ba0496f116d875fbe904cb384f34a8448faf0d1ba8cedf657426af7a91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc13f4857779ff3cb5467754",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛半程少量提升速度\\n且在沙土比赛发动技能时\\n若不在第3弯道\\n则额外稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8874772b22a7c62ea5d4b67d204897da840c1b787a6f413ba926808f85430e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128602e4550a2edcf4c110ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于第3名及以后\n且正前方或正后方长时间有赛马娘时\n短暂向前突进\n若是泥地比赛则持续向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd7deca05375a1c96d8c8974e6a121fc1b6cfd5a48d917a6a2c11848422c57f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24adc0e4f52d69ba9d7f4f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于有利位置时\\n一段时间内速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d46f857ae8d1f1a9870cc1640bad95534e7e9b7f5f7c7480402205aa964786",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601c6ccc1c80afb321816360",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时稍微放慢速度\\n之后在比赛终盘初期极快向前突进\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e674d4ec18f18fb19df40d99bf1d97b773b186c8d54c694e7f8425f44bf2ec7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e916205fc00027c1e2867c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n速度和加速度少量提升＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "94674449691c94c703d10d10a43a9171ebd05f0a4bdb0100a2248d620daa01e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1621ad4eb467cbdb0b88418",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d804446b27f86e8ff7d3f1bb6d5bdebef16dacb7aebcff768fb46ccc6b5cce6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c04d9f915000bdc02d71eb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段为止保持在前方的话\n在终盘的最终直线提升速度\n若是中距离比赛则大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9907f3cd442f922f27c91f06bcd823e5e1c78a1e0c1123e6078a4b58de58fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0b99b0d95b672def3a8224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中距离比赛的前半段若能保持\\n名次位于前方,则长时间内速度持续少量提升\\n若发动了「大逃」技能,则效果改变\\n变为大幅回复耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64dd6a7959e1b1d21a24200da9b3fb63a95dba2e573cb577e75a30a592bbd0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a2d49b3ab670d15f68643be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于第二名开外\\n则速度提升,若比赛中盘正好\\n发动7次或是13次技能\\n则变为速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d22f4693ec666a5c4ddec7d173c4a497af27cc7b4ac97198e624c0043c4f5cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8514cd9d161a3a5f04a75150",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘准备超越时\\n短时间内小幅向前突进,之后在\\n终盘的最终弯道后半位于中后方时\\n短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8dca9054046c75a15078fff33cd4d4c631e2b56f0e0ce308652f2c3f52666d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7719cf3c8179be32776814",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘逼近时若处于前方\\n持续小幅度提升速度\\n若在前三名内则持续小幅度增加加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f4a7772838b9333c0458b90ef5e26b3a0fa740f7af398e6fc6ec304c45a5f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd7addace24598db477308c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是三后冠的赛道\\n则在终盘的弯道短时间内小幅向前突进\\n如果此时为下坡,则额外稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe6a939b38aca79aa3f14de2911cb31cdb73588f1f047a9777b3936cf836680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9ee38a5268c7e4d4377226",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段短时间内速度大幅提升\\n如果是中距离比赛\\n效果会更加显著＜战术·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "594cebd6a08ebca64751b438bcd23e62507ee70314c768b738038be28beac670",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d470f6b29b124520565fc60f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若智力有十二分高超则提高效果量\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fece8b3839fc7eb66fa8a97ab1ca54d9bdae4331d5fa52144be2255b5c3cd14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5654b17dbfcf048e48f9b11f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的初期位于队伍中后方时\\n速度提升,之后进入比赛后半段的下坡时稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "129261166111ff0fa748a1e261a3628bd369b4803025cfa6976f7668b4edef99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4cb64722c84ec1fca3eecb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于前方\\n被靠近时,速度少量提升\\n若为中距离比赛且干劲为绝好调\\n则速度进一步略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d308fb19991c2faf940572be2e4636874e8411f45738efba3ac105886a3db19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1720f3cba8ab8f14ded83522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间点位于中团时\\n在剩余400m处速度大幅提升\\n技能发动时若处于有利位置\\n则效果提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dcf1a0a0ed91dea24ca195b3b99ff6a5d5da977ed27d5f8a4ea16d475b8a06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bbb770247dea7d7bb5d502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m地点位于后方时短暂略微向前突进，\n若是长距离比赛，之后若在终盘的弯道超越过\n则在最终直线短暂提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d4bc25be3defd232d4ef45f7ec5c347c13a1bf8d7859a4ac38d2af8cd035443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a574aa37ffc650fa9f8628fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若是英里赛则效果进一步提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "595350d921964dea04b78f91dace2fd7a39e0ae8bfea4fb706461e999a7a25b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6af7618a7d8db1b3c141abf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若是英里赛则效果进一步提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "595350d921964dea04b78f91dace2fd7a39e0ae8bfea4fb706461e999a7a25b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2941252a9d5c54792c237469",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于前方时\n短暂略微向前突进，若是英里或中距离比赛，\n之后在最终直线短暂大幅向前突进<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec7f8dfd0b6384edab6ce10c748ff116ba574b2ca937671bafd85265511b8199",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe0557759469a7d74f5e395",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时速度大幅提升\\n若是2200m的比赛则速度极大提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bdbb08116804ffcb88c97c616eca4471fc6e1a1cc0911e55df13b429824546",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8039ce1307b25a1fb045a7f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于前方时加速度大幅提升\\n若是2200m的比赛,则消耗少量耐力\\n使加速度在终盘初期更早时间内大幅提升＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "73470816d9f41e6f5ecd5997edd876055ab8282b70a8e984a1f5d9e9effeb273",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111301211"
      ]
    },
    {
